,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Que tu le ressentes ou pas, ces semaines de récupération ou d'assimilation sont plus que nécessaires. Elles aident ton corps à bien encaisser les semaines plus intenses et te permettent ensuite de repartir du bon pied, sans risque de blessure, ce qui doit être ta priorité numéro un en tant que coureur ! (car un coureur blessé progresse toujours moins qu'un coureur qui en fait un peu moins mais qui est régulier !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.247813411078718,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Recup_S30_10_600_1","description":"Séance de seuil légère pour garder tes jambes actives sans trop pousser pendant la récupération. Enchaine sans repos 1' au Seuil 60 puis 1' au Seuil 30. Prends ensuite 2' de repos, puis recommence encore 3 fois pour un total de 4 séries.","displayName":"Séance intense facile","coachAdvice":"En semaine de récupération, la séance de fractionné est une séance qu'on appelle « d'entretien ». La priorité n'est pas de progresser mais d'évacuer la fatigue. La séance est donc volontairement abordable pour garder le corps en action (pour éviter de régresser) mais sans générer de fatigue.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a6894d5ba18ec460531f220","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1786924800000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":2,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity"